  Occupation: State Security Personnel
  CharacterDescription: "Full uniform, full mask. Doesn't give a name. Doesn't need to. Passes through on rotation like every other one of them \u2014 indistinguishable by design. Treats the checkpoint as an inconvenience and you as a minor obstacle in his day."
  CharacterArc: "Straight-backed, arms at his sides, head tilted just enough to suggest he's deciding whether you're worth his time. He's not hostile exactly \u2014 more like perpetually unimpressed. He follows the process because the state demands it, not because he respects it. If you're efficient and professional, something shifts slightly. He'll never say so. But he'll stop sighing."
